        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LOG150SLVSS4, 1-1/2 Inch Wood Door Pull with Stainless Steel Sleeves and Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Wooden Door Handle with Stainless Steel End Caps is available in 3 lengths: 18 inches, 24 inches, and 36 inches--all of which are comprised of a 1-1/2 inch diameter wood grip. The wood finish is up to you because First Impressions offers <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\" target=\"new\">different types wood types</a>. The brackets and sleeves are available in either satin stainless steel or polished stainless steel. This Laguna Series 8 Wood Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/wooden-1-inch-door-handle-with-stainless-steel-end-caps-first-impressions-log100slvss4\"><b>1 Inch Wooden Door Handle with Stainless Steel End Caps</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LOG150SLVSS4 Logan Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LGN08-specifications.pdf?v=1704262329\"><b>First Impressions LOG150SLVSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LOG150018SLVSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LOG150024SLVSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LOG150036SLVSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
